message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated STD-Net paper and this software release."
title: "STD-Net support-aware dual-graph learning"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/justlee172/STD_Net"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.23266460"
abstract: >-
  Support-aware dual-graph neural network software for spatial transcriptomic
  cell-type deconvolution. This release contains the support_rare_balanced
  implementation, paper-aligned wrappers and tests; input data and numerical
  results are intentionally excluded.
type: software
keywords:
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - cell-type deconvolution
  - graph neural networks
  - sparse composition
  - rare cell types
